        "language": "english",
        "review": "I Just finished my playthrough of Act. 1 and all I can say is that I can't wait for more. It's definitely reminiscent of Kingdom Hearts and DMC gameplay. I missed that 2000s action gameplays games had back then, so this game is in the right direction. The final boss for act 1 sure gave me a run for my money, but I enjoyed it. Shout out to the devs for this project.",
